=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a87dc26eddc34aa8d741346b6fa30c5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3ae8ce5/uploads/origins/8c9df113-59c3-4b07-8807-c77a54923d6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a87dc26eddc34aa8d741346b6fa30c5, https://si.imgix.net/b3ae8ce5/uploads/origins/8c9df113-59c3-4b07-8807-c77a54923d6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8cec8ab608706e6b79484ca886547ad5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3ae8ce5/uploads/origins/8c9df113-59c3-4b07-8807-c77a54923d6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05e05b901a83e9118b16372efb56de3e 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\n応援している配信者さんにイラストをプレゼントしたく絵師さんを探していたところ、森川りょうさんの作品をお見かけしました。\nどの絵もとても素敵で、特にロリータファッションの子が可愛らしさ全開で(プレゼント予定の配信者さんもとても好きな絵柄！と気に入っており)、今回依頼させていただきました。\n\n描いてほしい女の子のイメージはこんな感じです。全体としてはふわっとした可愛らしい女の子が理想です。\n\n服装    ···▸﻿ゴスロリファッション\n                 (宜しければふりふりのドレスを着さ\n                  せてくれると嬉しいです。)\n髪型    ···▸﻿﻿編み込みカチューシャ\n目        ···▸﻿中に小さなハート\n                  (参考画像の女の子のような目をイメ\n                    ージしています。)\n表情    ···▸﻿「可愛いね」と褒めてもらって嬉しそ\n                   うな、誇らしげに笑っている\n背景    ···▸﻿お任せします。\n構図    ···▸﻿サムネイルに使用したいので、身体は\n                見切れないようにしてくださると助か  \n                ります。その他はお任せします。\nその他···▸﻿お洋服やアクセサリーのどこかに黒      \n                 猫(🐈‍⬛)を描いてくれると嬉しいで  \n                 す。デジタルグッズを制作したいた\n                 め、透過イラストと背景をレイヤー\n                 分けして納品していただけますでし    \n                 ょうか。\n\n参考画像はこちらです。\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ehsFHi2inyWwwpKH6\n\n                 \n参考画像を載せておりますが、こちらはあくまで参考程度でアレンジして頂いて大丈夫です！\n\n冒頭触れさせて頂きましたが、イラストはプレゼント用で、プレゼント後の使用用途は下記の通りです。\n\n・デジタルグッズの制作\n    (配信サムネイル、Twitterヘッダー、アイコ          \n      ンリング等)\n・返礼品として上記制作品の配布\n\n長文依頼失礼しました。\nぜひ森川りょうさんのイラストを見てみたいので、よろしくお願いします！！\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ehsFHi2inyWwwpKH6", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kerowakame/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1222261, "client_id": 2168110, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e05c2bcfb2849cfe488f5406fe105df8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e05c2bcfb2849cfe488f5406fe105df8, https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce7c0f4cd380daa69ad9af54e56cd6ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4f1d03e58c24b246b3a02c9289765a7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5bf61749b851e61cc01e4d011f9e26e3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5bf61749b851e61cc01e4d011f9e26e3, https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=503365daf058c489fbbc371b609b5f38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7566e63/uploads/origins/4b6d0052-d9ed-40df-ae04-ac5eb5ae3688?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bae0c8eec40c520177e163920214dc04 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! We have requested your work because of your nice pattern.\nIf you don't mind, would it be possible for us to ask you to draw our OC, \"Mel Hinashiro\"?\nFor your reference, the setting is as shown at the end of this page, but you can draw freely.\n\nWe would appreciate it if the address and background can be turned on/off in psd.\nI would like to use it for all my personal activities (illustrations for novels, introduction of characters on SNS, personal websites, etc., announcement of personal activities, etc., reference material for requests for commissions, etc.).\nIf you are available, please contact me.\n\nI am looking forward to working with you.\nMeru Hinashiro\nA girl who likes to wear brightly-patterned Lolita fashion and is always happily playing with spirits.\nShe has the ability to create spirits (like messengers or little fairies) from people's souls, called \"spirit workshop.\nShe was born sickly and weak and spent a long time in the hospital, and is not good at socializing with others.\nShe has no friends at school and always rests in the nurse's office.\nSince she does not know how to relate to others, she creates many spirits from her own soul to fill her loneliness.\nHowever, the spirits created from his own soul alone will disappear over time, and Mel Hinashiro feels the limitations of creating mascots from pieces of his own soul.\nWhen she realizes that in order to give \"immortal life\" to spirits who have been promised extinction, she needs \"human life\" in addition to souls, she begins to desire it and wants the lives of those around her.\n\n● Mehfi\nOne of her offshoots (spirits immortalized by being given human life) created by Mel Hinadai's \"spirit workshop\" ability. She is like a surrogate for Mel Hinadai's father.\nMel Hinashiro immortalized Mehfi by giving her the life of her own father.\nShe looks like a gray alien.\nHe is mistaken for an alien by witnesses.\n\"\"\"", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 10